    "body": "<p><strong>Release:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/datasette/datasette-charts/releases/tag/0.2a1\">datasette-charts 0.2a1</a></p> <blockquote> <p>Minor UI improvements:</p> <ul> <li>Collapsing the <strong>suggested charts</strong> section now leaves the chart visible.</li> <li>Following a link to a chart opens it with the suggestions collapsed for that visit.</li> <li>On table pages the panel now sits below the \"4,235 rows where country = CHN\" line.</li> <li>The \"Data\" table under each chart has been replaced by <strong>Copy TSV</strong> and <strong>Copy CSV</strong> buttons.</li> <li>Removed the \"Chart this data\" item from the table, view and query action menus.</li> <li>More space between lines in chart tooltips.</li> </ul> </blockquote> <p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/t",
